                    'image': '<div class="col-lg-6"><span class="thumb-info thumb-info-no-borders thumb-info-no-borders-rounded thumb-info-lighten thumb-info-bottom-info thumb-info-bottom-info-dark thumb-info-bottom-info-show-more thumb-info-no-zoom"><span class="thumb-info-wrapper"><img src="{{asset('assets/front/img/services/tile-and-grout-before.jpg')}}" class="img-fluid service-img" alt="Dirty tile and grout."></span></span></div><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="thumb-info thumb-info-no-borders thumb-info-no-borders-rounded thumb-info-lighten thumb-info-bottom-info thumb-info-bottom-info-dark thumb-info-bottom-info-show-more thumb-info-no-zoom"><span class="thumb-info-wrapper"><img src="{{asset('assets/front/img/services/tile-and-grout-after.jpg')}}" class="img-fluid service-img" alt="Want your tiles to look new and shiny? A Tile and Grout Clean"></span></span></div></div>',
                    'description': '<p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100">Want your tiles to look new and shiny? A tile and grout clean is what you require.</p><p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100">Overtime, grout between tiles build up and results in discolouration and mould. By making use of the correct equipment, your tiles can be restored in no time.  At Synergy, we make use of a simple scrub brush to clean grout or a turbo steam cleaner depending on the state of the tiles.</p><p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100">Getting your tiles cleaned is of utmost importance as it prevents the buildup of germs and bacteria, reduces the risk of damaging the tiles whilst lengthening the longevity of the tiles. We do not restrict ourselves but instead we clean a wide range of tile materials including marble, quartz, terracotta, porcelain, limestone, ceramic, slate, sandstone etc.</p>'
