                    'description': '<p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100">Strip and Sealing is the process of removing the old sealer from the floor surface and laying new coats of sealer to the floor in several layers.</p><p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100">This is done in order to protect the vinyl from minor damage caused by natural wear and tear. In addition to this, it helps keep the floors looking new.The following factors will help you decide how often you need to strip and seal to protect your floors.</p><p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100"><i class="fa fa-circle color-red"></i><span>The amount of traffic through the floor/ what items are used i.e. for instance trolleys.</span></p><p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100"><i class="fa fa-circle color-red"></i><span>How the floor is maintained (Swept/Vacuumed/Mopped/Scrub and Buff) and what it is cleaned with. Some brooms have quite abrasive bristles on them, which can cause damage to the floor. Also, some chemicals will eat away the sealer, so it is very important that you use a PH neutral floor cleaner on your sealed floors and that the chemical dilution rates are correct. Even a PH neutral floor cleaner will become alkaline if not diluted correctly, which will eat away at the floor sealer.</span></p><p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100"><i class="fa fa-circle color-red"></i><span>Number of coats applied on the floor at last service and quality of the sealer.</span></p><p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100"><i class="fa fa-circle color-red"></i><span>Use of the correct method of strip and seal.</span></p>'
                },
