                    'description': '<p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100">Graffiti is a common issue in and around the city and can usually lead to bad impressions of your business if your company site is affected.</p><p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100">It is best to remove graffiti within the first 24 to 48 hours to ensure effective removal. We understand that different surfaces require different chemicals and thus, we ensure that we use the right tools and expertise to remove all signs of graffiti without damaging the surface area.</p>'
