                    'description': '<p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100">High dusting is the process of cleaning hard-to-reach areas which includes the removal of bacteria, dust and dirt build-up.</p><p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100">This process is called high dusting because the areas that are being cleaned (air vents, ceilings, pipes, etc.) are usually over 16 feet high. Our staff are qualified with EWP licence, White Cards and Work Safely at Heights license which are nationally recognised.</p>'
