                    'description': '<p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100">Keeping the exterior environment of your facility is just as important as preserving the looks inside.</p><p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100">Driveways, carparks, paths, outdoor work areas and so on need to be cleaned as mould, stains, grime and dust are prone to deteriorate the looks and value. Starting off with the right cleaning chemical, the surfaces would be scrubbed if necessary and then cleaned using pressure washing.</p>'
