                    'description': '<p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100">Wash, clean and dry the window surfaces on the inside and outside to ensure that you maintain a healthy, dust-free and clean working environment.</p><p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100">At Synergy, we make use of tools and cleaning methods that have proven success over the years of operation. One of the methods include the Pure Water Fed Pole System which is a deionization system that yields 99.99% pure water.</p><p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100">The water dries without any streaks or spots, and there is no need for any soaps or squeegees. Pure water cleaning leaves windows absolutely spotless and "film-less" meaning they will actually stay clean longer. We can provide up to 4 storeys external building cleaning which would help you reduce your costs.</p>'
