                    'description': '<p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100">Housekeeping is a term that is invariably used in exchange for the term ‘cleaning’ and this could not be more inaccurate.</p><p class="appear-animation animated fadeInUpShorter appear-animation-visible ani-delay2" data-appear-animation="fadeInUpShorter" data-appear-animation-delay="100">Housekeeping is a set of services that are designed specifically for certain industries such as hospitality. Housekeeping takes a step further from cleaning as it includes tidying up and making the premises look presentable. If this is a service you require, you have come to the right place. We will carry out the tasks with minimal disturbance at times which are most convenient to you. We got you covered.</p>'
